) rock game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "hey you! yes you reading this. are you looking for a gorilla tag fan game to play with friends?? well its your lucky day! rockey mischief vr a gorilla locomotion game were you play as a rock. it has loads of maps and the devs go all out for updates/holidays the rockey mischief has a lot of cosmetics to chose from. holdables hats tops and more.so what are you still doing here download the game and have a good time with others!", "short_description": "rockey mischief a vr game with gorilla locomotion!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/10Wxox5b8tiTlHA_7CEHnq9dzrsm6Y9uSYtv8zlDR6pA/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "lplayzz_vr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2ktvvuBQwCduHjt_ICptDg", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8477561172336114"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031565_501219342189638_7388540311070500298_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQdmwh6x_LgQ7kNvwEaJ-80&_nc_oc=AdqfOaGydSiNhnCeryY9neOc_o08TD0eH09av1sUHN20sCADfPmLe8sdtGXhjdhT04M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-OvFkR2hGzkVsb4ZrX1IRGnCWhHDXMKIhJsSWIQr78JQ&o